  "about": [
    "Points Tracker transfer data. This file is the single source of truth for transfer partners, ratios, scheduled changes and point valuations.",
    "The app bundles this file and also downloads https://aricthomas73.github.io/points-tracker-data.json. A download is used only if its revision is higher than the bundled one and it passes validation.",
    "To update rates without an App Store release: edit this file, raise revision (yyyymmddNN), then upload it to the aricthomas73.github.io repo as points-tracker-data.json.",
    "ratio = partner points received per 1 card point. display is the text shown, e.g. 4:3 means 4 card points give 3 partner points (ratio 0.75).",
    "scheduledChanges: action update (new ratio), add (new partner), remove (partner leaves). effective is the local day it takes effect. Before that day the app shows a note and reminds users who hold the source points.",
    "Program names must match the names in RewardAccount.swift exactly. Run Cmd+U after editing."
  ],
